                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikayaani waan jed'eeni, Anini worra Israeli ch'ufa ka gaareeni gubba firfirsani, hooliye tissitu inqamne fakaatu arga. Ammalle AABBO Waaqi waan jed'u, Worri kunini abba inqabu, ha namu nagayaani galuti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
