      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle Mikayaani waan jed'e, Amma waan AABBO Waaqi jed'e ch'aqasi! Anini AABBO Waaqa, ka barch'uma ufi ira tau, gubbati arge, ka malaikaani isaa mirgaafi bita isaa ejaanjitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan jed'u, Eenuti Ahabu soba, aka inni deeme Ramothiti duu? Malaikaani gari waan toko jette, ammo ta gari waan d'ibi jette. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani jinnini toko AABBO Waaqa dura d'ufte waan jetteeni, Anati isaa soba. AABBO Waaqi, Akami sobda? jed'e gaafate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jinnini waan jetteeni, Anini deeme raagoota Ahabu ch'ufa kiyyibsiisa. AABBO Waaqi waan jed'eeni, Beeni, isa sobi, inni inuma sobama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba Mikayaani waan jed'e, AABBO Waaqi yayu raagoota tante tana ch'ufa kiyyibsiise, ammo isumati si balleesu fed'a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani raagi Sedekiani Mikaya d'abanaase waan jed'eeni, Lubbuuni Waaqa yoomi na biraa deemte sini dubbate?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikayaani waan jed'eeni, Gaafa atini mana kanke seente keesati d'okhatu waan suni garta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Ahabuni waan jed'e, Mikaya qaba, gudda dira kana ka Amoni jed'anifi Yoashi ilma kiyyati geesa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waan jettaniini, Hayyichi waan jed'u, Nama kana mana hid'aansa keesa buusa, qit'aa gogafi bisaani ch'allaani gololcha, haga anini nagayaani galuti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikayaani waan jed'eeni, Yo atini d'uguma nagayaani galte, AABBO Waaqi naani indubbanne. Ammalle inni waan jed'e, D'iiro, isani nami ch'ufti d'uga naa taha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Duisa Ahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani hayyuuni Israelitiifi Yehoshefathini hayyu Yuda dira Ramothi ka Gileadi woliini had'u d'aqani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabuni waan Yehoshefathini jed'e, Anini woya tiyya jijirad'e nama d'ibi ufi tolche had'u d'aqa, ammo atini woya tante ta hayyutini had'u d'aqi. Duuba hayyichi Israeli woya jijirate nama d'ibi ufi tolche had'iisa d'aqe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyichi Shamu qara waan askarti isaa ta gaari fardi hirkisuti matatiini jed'e, Hayyu Israeli male, nama d'ibi tokole inhad'ina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba worri Yehoshefathi arge jennaani hayyu Israeli sehani iti gorani isa had'ani. Ammo inni iyye jennaani AABBO Waaqi isa baase worra isa had'u jiru kaani iraa deebise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri kaani aka inni hayyu Israeli intahini arge jennaani iraa deebie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo askartichi Shamu toko akanumati t'iya darbe, hayyu Israeli fulla miha isaa ka lola woltiini ejuuni woraane. Jennaani hayyichi waan nama gaari isaa oofuni jed'e, Anini ya madae, had'iisa ira nu deebisi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka had'iisi aka male jabaachu jiru, hayyu Ahabu gaari isaa keesati, fuula worra Shamuti deebisani jabeesani qabani. Aduuni d'iinaani ch'iche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka raagi toko Yehoshefathi gorse",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
